  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Boil the kettle.<br>• Chop cauliflower into small florets including <br>the stalk.<br>• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle <br>with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.<br>• Toss to coat. Roast until tender and brown <br>around the edges, 20-25 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f856860d0527cba53afd8c/step-1baa6a00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water <br>and a generous pinch of salt. Cook fusilli in the <br>boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes.<br>• Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people <br>/ 2/3 cup for 4 people). Drain fusilli, drizzle with <br>olive oil and set aside. </p> <p><br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still <br>slightly firm in the centre.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f856860d0527cba53afd8c/step-e81ad610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. <br>• Pick thyme leaves. <br>• Slice pear(see ingredients) into thin wedges. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f856860d0527cba53afd8c/step-7a981e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return the saucepan to medium-high heat with <br>a drizzle of olive oil. Add the butter, plain flour, <br>garlic and garlic &amp; herb seasoning and cook <br>until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Stir in thickened cream, the milk, vegetable <br>stock and the reserved pasta water, then <br>simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Remove from heat, then stir through roasted <br>cauliflower, thyme and cooked pasta. Season <br>with pepper.<br>• Transfer pasta to a baking dish. Top with <br>Cheddar cheese. Bake until cheese is melted <br>and golden, 8-10 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f856860d0527cba53afd8c/step-2499a630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While pasta is baking, in a medium bowl, <br>combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and <br>olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.<br>• Add mixed salad leaves and pear. Toss <br>to combine. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f856860d0527cba53afd8c/step-56350740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide cheesy cauliflower pasta bake between <br>plates. Serve with pear salad. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f856860d0527cba53afd8c/step-b8d6d950.jpg"
    }
  ]
